        "id": "7c4775e4"
      },
      "source": [
        "## 4. Does onset predict sowing better than a fixed typical date?\n",
        "\n",
        "Two ways to predict each trial's sowing date, each learned **only from the other years** (leave-one-year-out):\n",
        "\n",
        "* **Fixed date:** the median sowing day of the other years' trials, the same for every site.\n",
        "* **Onset + typical gap:** the trial's onset plus the median onset-to-sowing gap of the other years' trials.\n",
        "\n",
        "Measures: **MAE** (average error in days), share of trials predicted **within ±10 and ±14 days**, and the correlation between predicted and actual sowing day."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": 6,
      "id": "70681bfc",
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/",
          "height": 174
        },
        "id": "70681bfc",
        "outputId": "481fbe33-d84e-4eda-8eb7-942667087e31"
      },
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "display_data",
